# Local env template (never commit real secrets)

Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) or export in the shell for one session.

```bash
# Crash reporting (N-OPS-01) — leave unset for offline / store DSN-off posture
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=https://KEY@oORG.ingest.sentry.io/PROJECT

# Device harnesses — __DEV__ builds only; never on production EAS profile
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SOAK=1
# EXPO_PUBLIC_CERT=1
# EXPO_PUBLIC_PERF_OVERLAY=1
```

See:

- `docs/ops/CRASH-REPORTING.md`
- `docs/ops/SOAK-PHYSICAL.md`
- `docs/ops/CEILING-CERT.md`
